[00:02.000]编曲 Arranger : 王可鑫 Eli.W (HOYO-MiX)
[00:03.000]制作人 Producer : 王可鑫 Eli.W (HOYO-MiX)
[00:13.099]Birds are born with no shackles / 若鸟儿生来并无镣铐
[00:18.694]Then what fetters my fate? / 又是什么束缚我命运
[00:24.964]Blown away, the white petals / 洁白的花瓣被风卷去
[00:30.152]Leave me trapped in the cage. / 留我独自受困于囚笼
[00:36.349]The endless isolation / 孤独无止无休
[00:39.525]Can't wear down my illusion / 却难以磨灭我的想象
[00:42.456]Someday, I’ll make a dream unchained / 不如试着解开梦的枷锁吧
[00:49.262]Let my heart bravely spread the wings / 让我的心勇敢地振翅飞翔
[00:53.286]Soaring past the night / 穿过深沉的黑夜
[00:56.165]To trace the bright moonlight / 去追逐皎洁的月光
[01:01.513]Let the clouds heal me of the stings / 让云朵治愈往日的痛楚
[01:05.343]Gently wipe the sorrow off my life / 从生命中温柔地拭去忧伤
[01:09.507]I dream / 这是我的梦
[01:18.501]What is meant by “miracle”, / 那与我无关的词汇“奇迹”
[01:24.683]A word outside my days? / 究竟隐藏着怎样的意义？
[01:30.982]Once again, repeat warbles / 我又一次重复啼啭
[01:36.167]But how could I escape? / 但如何才能得到解脱？
[01:42.834]No further hesitation / 从此不再纠结于
[01:45.644]On those unanswered questions / 那些没有答案的问题
[01:48.630]So now, I’ll make a dream unchained / 现在我解开梦的枷锁
